│ What will change (9)                                                                                               │
│  1 Verify the Tor Project signing key (A3C4F0F979CAA22CDBA8F512EE8CBC9E886DDD89) and install                       │
│    /usr/share/keyrings/deb.torproject.org-keyring.gpg                                                              │
│  2 Write /etc/apt/sources.list.d/tor.sources for bookworm                                                          │
│  3 Install packages in one apt transaction: tor deb.torproject.org-keyring nyx webtunnel unattended-upgrades apt-  │
│    listchanges                                                                                                     │
│  4 Write /etc/apt/apt.conf.d/52tor-relay-unattended-upgrades (security updates + Tor Project packages)             │
│  5 Write /etc/apt/apt.conf.d/20auto-upgrades                                                                       │
│  6 Add "/usr/bin/webtunnel-server ix," to /etc/apparmor.d/local/system_tor and reload tor's AppArmor profile       │
│  7 Back up and replace /etc/tor/torrc after tor --verify-config accepts the new version                            │
│  8 ufw allow 443/tcp comment 'Tor WebTunnel bridge HTTPS'                                                          │
│  9 Enable and restart tor@default                                                                                  │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ /etc/tor/torrc                                                                                                     │
│ # Generated by tor-relay-setup vtest on YYYY-MM-DD hh:mm:ss UTC.                                                   │
│ # Tor relay configuration.                                                                                         │
│ # Review Tor Project relay documentation before making manual changes.                                             │
│                                                                                                                    │
│ Nickname TestRelay                                                                                                 │
│ ContactInfo "tor-ops@example.org"                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                    │
│ # Bridge mode: unlisted entry point for users in censored networks.                                                │
│ BridgeRelay 1                                                                                                      │
│ # WebTunnel: the ORPort stays on localhost; the web server is the public side.                                     │
│ ORPort 127.0.0.1:auto                                                                                              │
│ AssumeReachable 1                                                                                                  │
│ ServerTransportPlugin webtunnel exec /usr/bin/webtunnel-server                                                     │
│ ServerTransportListenAddr webtunnel 127.0.0.1:15000                                                                │
│ ServerTransportOptions webtunnel url=https://bridge.example.org/Abc123secretPath                                   │
│ # Local link between tor and the transport. Always auto.                                                           │
│ ExtORPort auto                                                                                                     │
│ BridgeDistribution https                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                    │
│ # Disable local SOCKS listener on this relay-only server.                                                          │
│ SocksPort 0                                                                                                        │
│                                                                                                                    │
│ # Keep potentially sensitive log details scrubbed.                                                                 │
│ SafeLogging 1                                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                    │
│ # Relay-specific bandwidth limits. Tor applies these per second.                                                   │
│ RelayBandwidthRate 1640 KBytes                                                                                     │
│ RelayBandwidthBurst 8200 KBytes                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                    │
│ # Monthly accounting safety cap. Tor hibernates if this is exhausted.                                              │
│ AccountingStart month 1 00:00                                                                                      │
│ AccountingRule sum                                                                                                 │
│ AccountingMax 8381 GBytes                                                                                          │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Your web server needs this                                                                                         │
│ Inside the HTTPS server block for bridge.example.org (nginx; translate for other servers):                         │
│                                                                                                                    │
│     location = /Abc123secretPath {                                                                                 │
│         proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:15000;                                                                         │
│         proxy_http_version 1.1;                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                    │
│         ### Set WebSocket headers ###                                                                              │
│         proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;                                                                    │
│         proxy_set_header Connection "upgrade";                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                    │



